# Phone, sharing and cloud backup (all small; features are off until turned on).
# Phone Link: QR code for pairing, clipboard fallback, native phone app support.
python3-qrcode
xclip
kdeconnect
# DevOS Share: SSH tunnel (localhost.run) and UPnP for "Direct (my IP)".
# cloudflared is downloaded on first use, not shipped.
openssh-client
miniupnpc
# Cloud Backup: Google Drive / OneDrive.
rclone
xdg-user-dirs
# DevOS app windows: its own tools open in a native window, not a browser tab.
# (Qt5 WebEngine itself is already on the ISO through Falkon.)
python3-pyqt5.qtwebengine
# Family Safety: blocks DNS/DoH bypass while it is on (off by default).
nftables
# Emoji: DevOS apps, websites and chats showed empty boxes for icons.
fonts-noto-color-emoji
# DevOS Security: virus scanning (signatures download on first boot), clamd for
# 8 GB+ PCs, firewall, automatic security updates, sandbox status.
clamav
clamav-base
clamav-freshclam
clamav-daemon
clamdscan
ufw
plasma-firewall
unattended-upgrades
apparmor
